'After identification/application: Dr suspense ₹12,000; Cr interest receivable ₹2,000; Cr principal ₹8,000; Cr borrower advance ₹2,000.',
'Net bank increase is ₹12,000. Allocation has no second bank debit. Closing POS = ₹42,000 and advance liability = ₹2,000.',
